  "question": {
    "text": "Sea water is 3.5% by mass of common salt and has a density  <math><mn>1.04</mn></math>  g  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>  at 293 K. Assuming the salt to be sodium chloride, then osmotic pressure of sea water will be (assume complete ionisation of the salt)"
